sequenceDiagram
    participant Orders as Order service
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Kafka as Kafka

    Note over Orders,DB: The order row, order_log, alert, and outbox commit in one transaction
    Orders->>DB: insert outbox row with published_at null
    loop each sweep
        Orders->>DB: oldest 50 unpublished rows
        Orders->>Kafka: send topic, key is the order id
        alt broker accepts the record
            Orders->>DB: set published_at
        else send fails or is interrupted
            Note over Orders,Kafka: leave the row unpublished and retry on the next sweep
        end
    end
